WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.520
Can I tell you a secret?

2
00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.380
There's no single fix

3
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.420
because every gummy smile has a different
cause.

4
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.180
That's why in our Forma consult,

5
00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.480
we'll start by pinpointing the exact source

6
00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.380
of your gummy smile before recommending any
treatment.

7
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.680
If your gum tissue is just too thick

8
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.040
and covering up your teeth,

9
00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.440
a quick gingivectomy shapes the gum line

10
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.120
to reveal your full natural smile.

11
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.560
If there's too much underlying bone
structure,

12
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.960
crown lengthening gently reshapes both the
bone

13
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.280
and the tissue for a balanced look.

14
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.440
And if your upper lip simply pulls up too
high,

15
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.040
we can use lip repositioning

16
00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:38.920
or even non-surgical options like Botox.

17
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.840
Ready to find your ideal fit?

18
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.540
Book your Forma consult today.